START POMODORO
	You start the timer by typing:
$ pcg [work-time] [break-time] [repetitions]
	
    work-time and break-time both must be in minutes (decimal values are not
accepted), and repetitions can be -1, meaning "until the program exits". If
you use this value, you will obtain points depending of the amount of times
you finished a work-time timer to use them as whatever you want.
    
GARDEN
    To enter the garden you just have to type the command with no value.
    If you use points, you need 5 for a new plant, and 7 to make it grow to
their next stage, but if not, you earn 5 for each pomodoro you established.
	The garden will look something like this:

+-points 000-----+
|░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░|
|░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░|
