PLANTS
	The possible states of a block can be:
Nothing (░░): just grass. PS0
finish two timers to make it grow again. PSD
Growing (🌱): this is the first stage of a plant. PS1
Keep growing(🌿): second stage of a plant. PS2
You can do it! (🌳): third stage of a plant. PS3
Dry (🪾 ): this happens if you break a pomodoro before finish it, having to
Wow! (🌻): this will grow in your garden if you're lucky. PSL
